1085
01:13:50.000 --> 01:13:52.000
[Allison and Emily scream]

1086
01:13:53.000 --> 01:13:55.000
[Allison] No, no.

1087
01:13:58.000 --> 01:13:59.000
Mom!

1088
01:14:01.000 --> 01:14:02.000
[Allison] Get closer!

1089
01:14:03.000 --> 01:14:04.000
[grunts]

1090
01:14:05.000 --> 01:14:06.000
No, Mom!

1091
01:14:11.000 --> 01:14:13.000
Aah!

1092
01:14:15.000 --> 01:14:16.000
[Allison] Cole!

1093
01:14:16.000 --> 01:14:17.000
Allison!

1094
01:14:20.000 --> 01:14:21.000
[grunts]

1095
01:14:32.000 --> 01:14:33.000
Aah!

1096
01:14:34.000 --> 01:14:35.000
[effort grunt]

1097
01:14:39.000 --> 01:14:41.000
Get off me!

1098
01:14:44.000 --> 01:14:47.000
[growls and grunts]

1099
01:14:48.000 --> 01:14:51.000
[growls]

1100
01:15:06.000 --> 01:15:08.000
Daddy, use your uppercut!

1101
01:15:18.000 --> 01:15:19.000
[growls]

1102
01:15:27.000 --> 01:15:28.000
[coughs]

1103
01:15:46.000 --> 01:15:47.000
[grunts]

1104
01:15:48.000 --> 01:15:50.000
[both grunting]

1105
01:15:59.000 --> 01:16:00.000
[screams]

1106
01:16:10.000 --> 01:16:11.000
[grunts]

1107
01:16:17.000 --> 01:16:19.000
[Cole breathing heavily]

1108
01:16:23.000 --> 01:16:25.000
[Cole and Allison sigh]

1109
01:16:28.000 --> 01:16:30.000
You okay?

1110
01:16:30.000 --> 01:16:32.000
We're fine. Are you okay?

1111
01:16:32.000 --> 01:16:33.000
Yeah.

1112
01:16:34.000 --> 01:16:35.000
Badass suit, Dad.

1113
01:16:40.000 --> 01:16:42.000
[sighs wearily]

1114
01:16:44.000 --> 01:16:45.000
Blade!

1115
01:16:49.000 --> 01:16:51.000
[effort grunt]

1116
01:16:52.000 --> 01:16:53.000
Help!

1117
01:16:53.000 --> 01:16:55.000
[breathing heavily]

1118
01:17:02.000 --> 01:17:04.000
[effort grunt]

1119
01:17:49.000 --> 01:17:52.000
[lightning crackling]

1120
01:17:54.000 --> 01:17:57.000
-What's that?
-It's okay.

1121
01:17:57.000 --> 01:17:58.000
It's a doorway back...

1122
01:18:00.000 --> 01:18:01.000
It's not over.

1123
01:18:08.000 --> 01:18:09.000
Impossible.

1124
01:18:09.000 --> 01:18:13.000
Thank you for helping
my fighter find his arcana.

1125
01:18:14.000 --> 01:18:18.000
After 4000 years, the Hasashi
bloodline still lives on.

1126
01:18:19.000 --> 01:18:21.000
Bi-Han.

1127
01:18:23.000 --> 01:18:25.000
[lightning crackling]

1128
01:18:28.000 --> 01:18:29.000
Stop him!

1129
01:18:29.000 --> 01:18:31.000
[grunts]

1130
01:18:40.000 --> 01:18:42.000
Your soul's mine.

1131
01:18:44.000 --> 01:18:45.000
[Lao screaming]

1132
01:18:45.000 --> 01:18:47.000
He's about
to get his soul sucked.

1133
01:18:47.000 --> 01:18:49.000
I love the scream
right before--

1134
01:18:50.000 --> 01:18:51.000
[both grunting]

1135
01:18:52.000 --> 01:18:54.000
[Lao screaming]

1136
01:18:54.000 --> 01:18:56.000
-Gotcha.
-[gasps]

1137
01:19:01.000 --> 01:19:03.000
[screaming]

1138
01:19:08.000 --> 01:19:10.000
[screams]

1139
01:19:10.000 --> 01:19:12.000
Shang Tsung!

1140
01:19:18.000 --> 01:19:20.000
No!

1141
01:19:26.000 --> 01:19:28.000
[Blade] Where are we?

1142
01:19:28.000 --> 01:19:30.000
[Raiden] We are in the void.

1143
01:19:30.000 --> 01:19:33.000
It is the realm
between your world and mine.

1144
01:19:33.000 --> 01:19:35.000
Shang Tsung
cannot follow us here.

1145
01:19:50.000 --> 01:19:52.000
If we're to die...

1146
01:19:53.000 --> 01:19:55.000
it was supposed
to be together.

1147
01:19:57.000 --> 01:19:59.000
I'm sorry, Liu Kang.

1148
01:20:02.000 --> 01:20:04.000
Without Kung Lao,

1149
01:20:06.000 --> 01:20:08.000
Earthrealm is lost.

1150
01:20:09.000 --> 01:20:11.000
[Jax] Lord Raiden.

1151
01:20:11.000 --> 01:20:13.000
Why couldn't you save him?

1152
01:20:13.000 --> 01:20:14.000
All the gods are forbidden

1153
01:20:14.000 --> 01:20:18.000
from engaging in one realm's
war against another.

1154
01:20:18.000 --> 01:20:20.000
It is my job
to protect Earthrealm

1155
01:20:20.000 --> 01:20:22.000
but I cannot save
every soul within it.

1156
01:20:24.000 --> 01:20:25.000
No.

1157
01:20:25.000 --> 01:20:29.000
It's not over,
we still need to fight.

1158
01:20:33.000 --> 01:20:35.000
Cole.

1159
01:20:35.000 --> 01:20:38.000
The blood on this blade
is your ancestor's.

1160
01:20:38.000 --> 01:20:40.000
Hanzo Hasashi's.

1161
01:20:40.000 --> 01:20:43.000
I took it from him
the day he died.

1162
01:20:43.000 --> 01:20:47.000
Use it and the spirit of Hanzo
fights with you.

1163
01:20:51.000 --> 01:20:52.000
So what's the plan?

1164
01:20:54.000 --> 01:20:55.000
We need to fight smarter.

1165
01:20:56.000 --> 01:20:57.000
We need to control the fight.

1166
01:20:58.000 --> 01:20:59.000
How?

1167
01:20:59.000 --> 01:21:00.000
I mean, they're better trained
and better prepared.

1168
01:21:01.000 --> 01:21:02.000
Plus they don't mind
breaking the rules.

1169
01:21:05.000 --> 01:21:07.000
We need to split them up.

1170
01:21:07.000 --> 01:21:10.000
Lord Raiden,
can you send anyone anywhere?

1171
01:21:11.000 --> 01:21:12.000
Well, they don't want
a tournament.

1172
01:21:12.000 --> 01:21:13.000
Let's give them one.

1173
01:21:13.000 --> 01:21:15.000
But let's do it our way.

1174
01:21:16.000 --> 01:21:17.000
Give me Reiko.

1175
01:21:17.000 --> 01:21:19.000
I got a score to settle.

1176
01:21:29.000 --> 01:21:30.000
Hey, big boy!

1177
01:21:32.000 --> 01:21:34.000
[screams]

1178
01:21:34.000 --> 01:21:35.000
Sonya...

1179
01:21:36.000 --> 01:21:37.000
Please tell me I get
the bitch with the teeth.

1180
01:21:37.000 --> 01:21:39.000
You get to take out
your old buddy, Kano.

1181
01:21:41.000 --> 01:21:43.000
I know I've seen you
kick his ass before,

1182
01:21:43.000 --> 01:21:45.000
but he's got a laser now.
Watch out for that.

1183
01:21:45.000 --> 01:21:46.000
Oh, I got an idea.

1184
01:21:48.000 --> 01:21:49.000
Honey, I'm home.

1185
01:21:49.000 --> 01:21:51.000
Liu and I will take
Mileena and Kabal.

1186
01:21:52.000 --> 01:21:54.000
I know this is
personal for you.

1187
01:21:54.000 --> 01:21:55.000
Are you ready?

1188
01:22:04.000 --> 01:22:05.000
[Kabal] You again.

1189
01:22:07.000 --> 01:22:08.000
What about Sub-Zero?

1190
01:22:08.000 --> 01:22:10.000
Nobody's taking him
out one on one.

1191
01:22:10.000 --> 01:22:11.000
Yeah.

1192
01:22:11.000 --> 01:22:13.000
We save Sub-Zero for last.

1193
01:22:13.000 --> 01:22:16.000
We take him out together
as a team.

1194
01:22:19.000 --> 01:22:21.000
[grunts]

1195
01:22:23.000 --> 01:22:25.000
[grunting]

1196
01:22:42.000 --> 01:22:44.000
[grunting]

1197
01:22:51.000 --> 01:22:52.000
Oh-oh.

1198
01:22:52.000 --> 01:22:54.000
[grunting]

1199
01:22:55.000 --> 01:22:56.000
[screams]

1200
01:23:00.000 --> 01:23:01.000
[yelling]

1201
01:23:15.000 --> 01:23:16.000
[groaning]

1202
01:23:17.000 --> 01:23:19.000
[effort grunt]

1203
01:23:22.000 --> 01:23:23.000
Yeah, these motherfuckers work.

1204
01:23:25.000 --> 01:23:27.000
[screams]

1205
01:23:29.000 --> 01:23:31.000
[screams]

1206
01:23:31.000 --> 01:23:33.000
Ah! Damn it!

1207
01:23:33.000 --> 01:23:34.000
I'd come out if I were you.

1208
01:23:35.000 --> 01:23:36.000
[grunts]

1209
01:23:36.000 --> 01:23:38.000
[both grunting]

1210
01:23:47.000 --> 01:23:48.000
[groaning]

1211
01:23:51.000 --> 01:23:53.000
[both grunting]

1212
01:24:06.000 --> 01:24:07.000
Oh!

1213
01:24:08.000 --> 01:24:09.000
Fucking bitch!

1214
01:24:10.000 --> 01:24:12.000
[screams]

1215
01:24:14.000 --> 01:24:15.000
Hey!

1216
01:24:18.000 --> 01:24:20.000
[screams and grunts]

1217
01:24:20.000 --> 01:24:22.000
[both grunting]

1218
01:24:23.000 --> 01:24:25.000
And you owe me...

1219
01:24:25.000 --> 01:24:27.000
three million dollars.

1220
01:24:30.000 --> 01:24:32.000
[both grunting]

1221
01:24:54.000 --> 01:24:55.000
Fucking hell!

1222
01:24:55.000 --> 01:24:57.000
This is a bit harder
than I thought.

1223
01:24:57.000 --> 01:25:00.000
-[Blade grunts]
-[chuckles]

1224
01:25:00.000 --> 01:25:03.000
Tell me, blondie,
how does that feel?

1225
01:25:04.000 --> 01:25:05.000
[gasps]

1226
01:25:06.000 --> 01:25:07.000
It feels fucking amazing...

1227
01:25:08.000 --> 01:25:09.000
-Oh!
-...mate.

1228
01:25:09.000 --> 01:25:10.000
[grunts]

1229
01:25:13.000 --> 01:25:15.000
[breathing heavily]

1230
01:25:21.000 --> 01:25:22.000
[chuckles]

1231
01:25:26.000 --> 01:25:28.000
[grunting]

1232
01:25:37.000 --> 01:25:39.000
[gasps]

1233
01:25:39.000 --> 01:25:41.000
Oh, I'm sorry, did I cut ya?

1234
01:25:41.000 --> 01:25:43.000
[screams]

1235
01:25:55.000 --> 01:25:56.000
What the fuck!

1236
01:26:00.000 --> 01:26:02.000
[grunts]

1237
01:26:08.000 --> 01:26:09.000
[dragon screeching]

1238
01:26:13.000 --> 01:26:15.000
[Kabal screams]

1239
01:26:25.000 --> 01:26:26.000
[Kang speaking
foreign language]

1240
01:26:27.000 --> 01:26:28.000
For Kung Lao.

1241
01:26:32.000 --> 01:26:34.000
[screeches]

1242
01:26:38.000 --> 01:26:40.000
Shit!

1243
01:26:53.000 --> 01:26:54.000
A little help!

1244
01:26:55.000 --> 01:26:56.000
[grunting]

1245
01:27:13.000 --> 01:27:14.000
That's pretty cool.

1246
01:27:14.000 --> 01:27:16.000
Little parting gift
from Kano.

1247
01:27:18.000 --> 01:27:20.000
[Allison] Okay.
I'm almost ready.

1248
01:27:20.000 --> 01:27:21.000
How about you?

1249
01:27:21.000 --> 01:27:23.000
Are you sure Dad's gonna be
able to find us?

1250
01:27:23.000 --> 01:27:24.000
Completely sure.
Look, I just want to get us

1251
01:27:25.000 --> 01:27:27.000
Fuck another four armed monster
showing up.

1252
01:27:34.000 --> 01:27:37.000
[ominous music playing]

1253
01:27:44.000 --> 01:27:45.000
[portal whooshes]

1254
01:28:01.000 --> 01:28:06.000
[Cole] Emily!

1255
01:28:06.000 --> 01:28:09.000
No! Emily! No!

1256
01:28:18.000 --> 01:28:20.000
Allison-- [grunts]

1257
01:28:24.000 --> 01:28:28.000
Finally the Hasashi bloodline
will end.

1258
01:28:29.000 --> 01:28:30.000
[screams]

1259
01:28:30.000 --> 01:28:32.000
[grunting]

1260
01:28:42.000 --> 01:28:43.000
[grunts]

1261
01:28:48.000 --> 01:28:49.000
[grunting]

1262
01:28:58.000 --> 01:29:01.000
Now you will die
with your family.

1263
01:29:03.000 --> 01:29:04.000
[grunts]

1264
01:29:06.000 --> 01:29:07.000
[screams]

1265
01:29:14.000 --> 01:29:15.000
[grunts]

1266
01:29:16.000 --> 01:29:18.000
[screams]

1267
01:29:25.000 --> 01:29:27.000
The blade of Hanzo.

1268
01:29:28.000 --> 01:29:30.000
[grunts]

1269
01:29:32.000 --> 01:29:35.000
[music crescendos]

1270
01:29:39.000 --> 01:29:40.000
Get over here.

1271
01:29:42.000 --> 01:29:43.000
[Sub-Zero grunts]

1272
01:29:50.000 --> 01:29:51.000
[speaking Japanese]

1273
01:29:58.000 --> 01:30:01.000
[both grunting]

1274
01:30:16.000 --> 01:30:17.000
[groans]

1275
01:30:20.000 --> 01:30:21.000
[blade whistles]

1276
01:30:37.000 --> 01:30:38.000
[speaking Japanese]

1277
01:30:50.000 --> 01:30:51.000
[icicles crackling]

1278
01:30:58.000 --> 01:31:00.000
[grunts]

1279
01:31:03.000 --> 01:31:05.000
[both grunting]

1280
01:31:13.000 --> 01:31:14.000
[grunts]

1281
01:31:18.000 --> 01:31:19.000
[groans]

1282
01:31:22.000 --> 01:31:24.000
[Cole screaming]

1283
01:31:43.000 --> 01:31:44.000
[grunts]

1284
01:32:13.000 --> 01:32:14.000
[grunts]

1285
01:32:23.000 --> 01:32:25.000
[speaking Japanese]

1286
01:32:27.000 --> 01:32:29.000
[all grunting]

1287
01:32:37.000 --> 01:32:38.000
[grunts]

1288
01:32:38.000 --> 01:32:39.000
[coughs]

1289
01:32:50.000 --> 01:32:51.000
[grunts]

1290
01:32:57.000 --> 01:32:58.000
[grunting]

1291
01:33:06.000 --> 01:33:07.000
[groans]

1292
01:33:09.000 --> 01:33:10.000
[groaning]

1293
01:33:12.000 --> 01:33:15.000
[both grunting]

1294
01:33:25.000 --> 01:33:27.000
[both gasp]

1295
01:33:29.000 --> 01:33:30.000
[panting]

1296
01:33:33.000 --> 01:33:34.000
[effort grunt]

1297
01:33:41.000 --> 01:33:42.000
[panting]

1298
01:33:47.000 --> 01:33:48.000
For the Lin Kuei.

1299
01:33:52.000 --> 01:33:55.000
[all grunting]

1300
01:34:04.000 --> 01:34:05.000
[groans]

1301
01:34:14.000 --> 01:34:16.000
[breathing heavily]

1302
01:34:19.000 --> 01:34:21.000
[speaking Japanese]

1303
01:34:30.000 --> 01:34:31.000
[icicles crackling]

1304
01:34:31.000 --> 01:34:32.000
-Dad.
-[softly] Okay. I got you.

1305
01:34:34.000 --> 01:34:35.000
[speaking Japanese]

1306
01:34:48.000 --> 01:34:50.000
[Sub-Zero screams]

1307
01:34:55.000 --> 01:34:57.000
[dramatic music playing]

1308
01:35:15.000 --> 01:35:17.000
[speaking Japanese]

1309
01:35:29.000 --> 01:35:30.000
[fire crackling]

1310
01:35:59.000 --> 01:36:00.000
[lightning crackling]

1311
01:36:06.000 --> 01:36:08.000
These are my friends.

1312
01:36:09.000 --> 01:36:10.000
I am Liu Kang.

1313
01:36:12.000 --> 01:36:14.000
Sit. I will warm you.

1314
01:36:21.000 --> 01:36:22.000
I'm impressed.

1315
01:36:24.000 --> 01:36:26.000
I thought you said
you couldn't get involved.

1316
01:36:27.000 --> 01:36:29.000
[ominous music playing]

1317
01:36:30.000 --> 01:36:32.000
Shang Tsung.

1318
01:36:49.000 --> 01:36:52.000
[Raiden] The prophecy
has been fulfilled.

1319
01:36:52.000 --> 01:36:55.000
Has the blood on your hands
taught you nothing?

1320
01:36:56.000 --> 01:37:00.000
[Tsung] No matter
how many of my people

1321
01:37:00.000 --> 01:37:03.000
there will always be another
to take their place.

1322
01:37:05.000 --> 01:37:09.000
Today you have killed
my warriors

1323
01:37:09.000 --> 01:37:11.000
and you think you have won.

1324
01:37:11.000 --> 01:37:14.000
But death
is only another portal.

1325
01:37:14.000 --> 01:37:16.000
[whooshes]

1326
01:37:22.000 --> 01:37:27.000
Next time I see you,
I will not bring fighters.

1327
01:37:28.000 --> 01:37:31.000
I will bring armies.

1328
01:37:31.000 --> 01:37:34.000
You will return to Outworld
at once.

1329
01:37:35.000 --> 01:37:36.000
Earthrealm--

1330
01:37:36.000 --> 01:37:38.000
[lightning crackling]

1331
01:37:43.000 --> 01:37:45.000
He talks so much.

1332
01:37:48.000 --> 01:37:50.000
[Cole] What happens next?

1333
01:37:50.000 --> 01:37:52.000
Today we are victorious.

1334
01:37:52.000 --> 01:37:55.000
But there are other enemies
to fight.

1335
01:37:56.000 --> 01:37:58.000
We cannot let our guard down.

1336
01:37:59.000 --> 01:38:02.000
I'll assemble a new list
of champions.

1337
01:38:04.000 --> 01:38:05.000
You must find them.

1338
01:38:07.000 --> 01:38:08.000
Who's first?

1339
01:38:19.000 --> 01:38:23.000
My man,
I was just about to call you.

1340
01:38:23.000 --> 01:38:25.000
I need you tomorrow night.

1341
01:38:25.000 --> 01:38:29.000
Sorry. My days fighting
for 200 bucks are done.

1342
01:38:29.000 --> 01:38:31.000
Oh, you're finally quitting,
huh?

1343
01:38:31.000 --> 01:38:34.000
Yeah, uh
something like that.

1344
01:38:34.000 --> 01:38:36.000
Where're you gonna go?

1345
01:38:36.000 --> 01:38:37.000
Hollywood.

1346
01:38:37.000 --> 01:38:41.000
Hollywood? What the hell's
in Hollywood?

1347
01:38:41.000 --> 01:38:43.000
Not what, who.

1348
01:38:44.000 --> 01:38:45.000
It's been fun.

1349
01:38:46.000 --> 01:38:47.000
[scoffs]

1350
01:38:48.000 --> 01:38:49.000
Hollywood. [scoffs]

1351
01:38:58.000 --> 01:39:02.000
[upbeat music playing]

1352
01:41:51.000 --> 01:41:56.000
[music continues playing]

